SL-2 objective: Find the parameter region of the punishment (confiscated fraction `f`, retention `ρ_ret`, horizon `T_v`, withdrawal delay `R_slots`, guarantee `q`) that simultaneously:
(a) makes recruiting the space needed to win a private branch cost more than what the attacker gains, and
