For `mc_honesto`: given esc and (ρ_ret,Tv,f_h), simulate for `nrep` years: number of incidents ~ Poisson(ε_h); for each incident loss L; total; compare mean to tope. Return mean and whether IC upper ≤ tope? Actually the closed form is ε_h·L. MC mean should match within MC error. I'll report mean and CI.

