For `bootstrap_Bemp`: resample tibs with replacement, recompute B with fixed denom and given x. Return vector.

For `mc_Bpar`: sample Pareto truncated. To sample truncated Pareto on [f_min,1]: inverse CDF. For density p(f) ∝ f^{-α}, CCDF = (f_min/f)^{α-1} truncated so CDF = (1-(f_min/f)^{α-1})/(1-(f_min/1)^{α-1}) for f in [f_min,1]. Invert: u ~ U(0,1); (f_min/f)^{α-1} = 1 - u·(1-(f_min)^{α-1}); f = f_min / (1 - u(1-f_min^{α-1}))^{1/(α-1)}. For α=1 handle log separately. Then B = mean(min(f,x))/mean(f). Use StableRNG. This is independent of the closed form.

