Unless Tv_max is not 1141. Let me recompute `max_perdida_honesta`: `esc.frac_max * ingreso_anual(esc; f_h=esc.f_h)`. esc.f_h = 1e-3. ingreso_anual = λ*f_h*I*T_AÑO_S = 1*1e-3*1*31536000 = 31,536. frac_max=0.01 → tope = 315.36. Cmax = tope/eps_h = 315.36/1e-3 = 315,360 (not 315.36!). I divided wrong earlier. Let me redo: max_perdida_honesta/eps_h = 315.36/0.001 = 315,360. Then Tv_max = (315360-30)/0.25 = 1,261,320. So A_ok at Tv_max=1.26e6: x=0.01/1.26e6=7.93e-9 < fmin=1e-8 → B_par returns 0 (x≤fmin). N_paid = 0.279/0.001 = 279. L = 0.25*1.26e6+30 = 315,030. cost = 279*1*315030 = 8.79e7 > V=1e4 → A true. So bisection finds Tv_min=520434 where cost crosses V. And Tv_max=1.26e6. So region non-empty. Good, my earlier arithmetic was wrong. And for ρ=1.0: Tv_max = (315360-30)/1.0 = 315,330. A_ok at Tv_max: x=0.01/315330=3.17e-8 > fmin. B = 1-(1e-8/3.17e-8)^{0.5}=1-sqrt(0.3155)=1-0.5617=0.438. βd=0.279 < B → N_paid=0 → cost=0 → A false. So empty. Hence r2 empty. Correct.

